  "summary": "A carefully attributed portfolio uses rearranging ferment-log sheets to explain the work before Ines’s weekly menu. Its greatest weakness is that the three proposed concepts largely repeat the same paper-piece object and narrative structure, offering little genuine conceptual choice."
